heck the Ldap-Group-Name attribute in the reply from the RADIUS server against a specific pattern, and update the reply from the RADIUS server with a specific value of Fortinet-Group-Name attribute and a custom message, and also handle the unsuccessful authentication request by canceling and rejecting it.</p></div>'},  {'from': 'human', 'value': 'here is the latest code'},  {'from': 'gpt', 'value': '<div class="markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark"><p>I'm sorry, but you did not provide any code. In order to help you with the latest code, please provide the updated code you want me to explain.</p></div>'},  {'from': 'human', 'value': '        ldap

