}
</code></div></div></pre><p>This code makes the "bsa" block execute first, and when the block complete, it will check the result of bsa_authentication_failed variable, if it's true, it updates the reply with "Authentication failed" message and reject the request. Otherwise, it will return and move to the next step which is to check the Auth-Type attribute.</p><p>It's important to test this code and make sure it works as expected before deploying it to a production environment.</p><p>It's also recommended to consult the official documentation of the RADIUS server, which will provide more detailed instructions on how to configure and troubleshoot the server.</p></div>'}]

