</code></div></div></pre><p>In this updated version of the <code>OAuthCredentials</code> class, the <code>FlowType</code> property is a string that represents the type of OAuth flow for the record, such as "AuthorizationCode", "ClientCredentials", or "ROPC". The <code>RefreshToken</code> property is a string that stores the refresh token, which can be used to obtain a new access token when the current one expires.</p><p>With these additional fields, you can store information for multiple OAuth flows in a single table and easily retrieve and manage them as needed. Remember to follow best practices for storing and protecting sensitive information, such as encrypting or hashing passwords and client secrets, and limiting access to the table to only authorized users and applications.</p></div>'}]

[ {'from': 'human', 'value': 'hello karim, I need to setup a multifactor authentication for my mikrotik vpn. here is the requirement.

1. Radius
