}
</code></div></div></pre><p>In this example, the contract uses the <code>SafeMath</code> library to perform arithmetic operations, this library provides functions like <code>add()</code>, <code>sub()</code>, <code>mul()</code>, etc, that automatically check for overflow and underflow conditions and revert the transaction if an overflow or underflow occurs.</p></div>'},  {'from': 'human', 'value': 'Can you write a large article from your previous responds including all anserws?'},  {'from': 'gpt', 'value': '<div class="markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark" bis_skin_checked="1"><p>​</p></div>'}]

