uation metrics, such as precision, recall, F1-score, and accuracy.</li></ol><p>Here's an example of how you could use the <code>isAnomaly</code> function to train a logistic regression model using the <code>gonum</code> library:</p><pre><div class="bg-black rounded-md mb-4"><div class="flex items-center relative text-gray-200 bg-gray-800 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans"><span>go</span><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"></svg>Copy code</div><div><code class="!whitespace-pre hljs language-go"><span class="hljs-keyword">package</span> main

