}
</code></div></div></pre><ol><li>Finally, add the following code to handle the form submission and create a new admin user:</li></ol><pre><div class="bg-black rounded-md mb-4"><div class="flex items-center relative text-gray-200 bg-gray-800 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans"><span>php</span><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"></svg>Copy code</div><div><code class="!whitespace-pre hljs language-php"><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-keyword">function</span> <span class="hljs-title">admin_user_generator_handle_form</span>(<span class="hljs-params"></span>) </span>{
