<span class="hljs-punctuation">}</span>
</code></div></div></pre><p>The application also allows users to update their profile using a <code>PUT</code> request to the <code>/profiles/{id}</code> endpoint. The request body contains the updated profile data as a JSON object:</p><pre><div class="bg-black rounded-md mb-4"><div class="flex items-center relative text-gray-200 bg-gray-800 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans"><span>json</span><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"></svg>Copy code</div><div><code class="!whitespace-pre hljs language-json"><span class="hljs-punctuation">{</span>
