[ {'From': 'Human', 'Value': "Code in C of a symmetrical cryptographic system by waves"}, {'from': 'gpt', 'value': '<div><p>Voici un exemple de code en C pour un systeme cryptographique symetrique par flots utilisant l'algorithme de chiffrement RC4 :</p><pre><div class="bg-black mb-4 rounded-md"><div class="flex items-center relative text-gray-200 bg-gray-800 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans"><span>scss</span><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"></svg>Copy code</div><div><code class="!whitespace-pre hljs language-scss"><span class="hljs-selector-id">#include</span> <stdio<span class="hljs-selector-class">.h</span>>
