de> to load the library at runtime and access its functions and classes.</p></li></ol><p>Here's some example code that demonstrates these steps:</p><pre><div class="bg-black mb-4 rounded-md"><div class="flex items-center relative text-gray-200 bg-gray-800 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-sans"><span>cpp</span><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"></svg>Copy code</div><div><code class="!whitespace-pre hljs language-cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">"CoreMinimal.h"</span></span>
